Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:08:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [PERF MDOE] Replace emergency limit
 relaxation with performance mode

Replace the charging-session relaxation switch with a performance mode
entry backed by the Health service.

Observe application state asynchronously and show progress or failure
summaries. Keep an uncertain state checked so users can retry disabling
the mode, and explain that it resets after a system reboot.

Add English, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese strings.

Change-Id: Ieac992d5831778b6b5917c7a3f0dee788ec60eda
